	"Description": "I really wanted to make a buildings mod to challenge myself!\u00A0 It isn't the best but its a simple one that everyone can use.\u00A0 \u00A0There are two versions, one with flowers and one without the purple flowers.\u00A0 I have provided screenshots of at least the ones without flowers in game, and then images of the buildings with the flowers outside of the game.\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Alongside the buildings, I have made a craftables mod that can work along side it!\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Both files are going to be uploaded but they are separate and do have to be added to the Mod's folder separately.\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy!\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Credits::\u00A0 \u00A0\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3826]untitledmaprecolour01 BY andrewist[/url]\uFEFF\u00A0 I love this recolor of the game, and provided screenshots of my buildings with this mod installed!\u00A0 Please check it out!",
